      ],
      "title": "#1 她回来了"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "708001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "真恋，你、你还好吗……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "708002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "你之前提起过，是在垃圾桶被狩猎者捡到的，对吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "708003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真恋",
          "text": "是的，在那之前我一直待在黑漆漆的垃圾袋里，是她打开袋子救出了我。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "708004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "那么，你知道自己是怎么进的垃圾袋吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "708005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真恋",
          "text": "狩猎者告诉我，我是被自己的主人丢进垃圾桶的……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "708006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "你亲眼见到自己被主人丢进垃圾桶了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "708007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真恋",
          "text": "不……没有……主人他不可能那么做……我、我不相信……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "708008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "有没有可能你被骗了，她是故意这么说，好让你跟她来到这里？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "708009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真恋",
          "text": "可是……如果我不是主人扔掉的……为什么当时过了那么久，他都没有出现找我呢……？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "708010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "真恋，你想不想查清楚当时的真相？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "708011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真恋",
          "text": "……真相？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "708012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "对，亲自找到你的主人，查清你被丢进垃圾桶里的真相。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "708013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真恋",
          "text": "……嗯，我愿意。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "708014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "那我们现在就走吧~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "708015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "千万小心，不要惊动他们。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "708016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "什么声音？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "708017",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "弹簧猫",
          "text": "是从那边传过来的，我去看看！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "708018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "…………",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "708019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "对不起嘛，我真的、真的不是故意的……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "708020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "真恋，你这是要去哪呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "708021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真恋",
          "text": "我……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "708022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "你们刚刚说的我们全都听见了，我们要带真恋离开这里，你、你休想再骗她！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "708023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "哦？你确定要离开这里吗，我的真恋？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "708024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真恋",
          "text": "是、是的，我想亲自去查清被丢进垃圾桶的真相……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "708025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "这么说，你怀疑我？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "708026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真恋",
          "text": "我、我……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "708027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "你可真是令我伤心呢，小真恋。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "708028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "我早就告诉过你，背弃过我的，无论是谁，都将是我的仇敌。我得好好想想，该怎么惩罚你才好呢，我的甜心？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "708029",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "狩猎者",
          "text": "给我拦住她们，一个都不能放过！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "708030",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "弹簧猫",
          "text": "遵命！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-81",
